      <TableCell>The deployment strategy to use to replace existing pods with new ones.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>template</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Template describes the pods that will be created. The only allowed template.spec.restartPolicy value is "Always".</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      </TableBody>
      </Table>
      <h3 id="_specinstallspecdeploymentsspecselector" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.install.spec.deployments[].spec.selector<a href="#_specinstallspecdeploymentsspecselector" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
