      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Label selector for pods. Existing ReplicaSets whose pods are selected by this will be the ones affected by this deployment. It must match the pod template’s labels.</p></dd>
