      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>An empty preferred scheduling term matches all objects with implicit weight 0 (i.e. it’s a no-op). A null preferred scheduling term matches no objects (i.e. is also a no-op).</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
