      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>topologyKey</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>This pod should be co-located (affinity) or not co-located (anti-affinity) with the pods matching the labelSelector in the specified namespaces, where co-located is defined as running on a node whose value of the label with key topologyKey matches that of any node on which any of the selected pods is running. Empty topologyKey is not allowed.</TableCell>
