      </TableHeader>
      <TableBody>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>localhostProfile</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>localhostProfile indicates a profile defined in a file on the node should be used. The profile must be preconfigured on the node to work. Must be a descending path, relative to the kubelet’s configured seccomp profile location. Must be set if type is "Localhost". Must NOT be set for any other type.</TableCell>
