      <TableCell><code>fsType</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>fsType is the filesystem type of the volume that you want to mount. Tip: Ensure that the filesystem type is supported by the host operating system. Examples: "ext4", "xfs", "ntfs". Implicitly inferred to be "ext4" if unspecified. More info: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/volumes#awselasticblockstore</TableCell>
