      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>A label selector is a label query over a set of resources. The result of matchLabels and matchExpressions are ANDed. An empty label selector matches all objects. A null label selector matches no objects.</p></dd>
