      <TableCell><code>apiGroups</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>array (string)</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>APIGroups is the API groups the resources belong to. '<em>' is all groups. If '</em>' is present, the length of the slice must be one. Required.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>apiVersions</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>array (string)</code></TableCell>
